I have raised a incident No 542 covering all MDM master upload-related issu=
es, as these are critical for the Go-Live. The relevant document has been a=
ttached to the incident for your reference.

If any further clarification is required, we can arrange a meeting with the=
 MDM team to discuss the all issues in detail.



The following few issues have been identified in the customer, vendor, and =
material creation programs:

  1.  ZMDM_MATERIAL_AUTO =96 Error occurring during program execution.
  2.  For certain material types, the system is treating some non-mandatory=
 fields as mandatory.
  3.  During Ship-to Party creation, the Company Code view is not required;=
 however, the program is making related fields mandatory.
  4.  YVMI Indirect Customer (Excel Upload) =96 Data reading issue from the=
 Excel file.
  5.  YVSP Sold-to Party (Excel Upload) =96 Some required fields are missin=
g in the upload template.
  6.  Customer extension is resulting in an error.
  7.  Vendor creation is giving errors related to tax fields.
  8.  LSMW programs are not working when executed in background jobs.



Considering the Go-Live timelines, request you to prioritize these issues a=
nd provide support for their resolution at the earliest.



Regards,
Pawan Sharma



